		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[Welcome to the <strong>new</strong> blog. This post was written in the <em>classic editor</em>, so it has no paragraph tags.

A second paragraph, with a <a href="https://wordpress.org/">link</a>
and a line break inside it.

[caption id="attachment_10" align="aligncenter" width="300"]<a href="https://example.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/bike.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10" src="https://example.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/bike-300x200.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="200" /></a> Our bike, <em>by the river</em>[/caption]

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ

<h2>Things to pack</h2>
<ul>
	<li>A map</li>
	<li>Snacks<ul><li>Apples</li><li>Bread</li></ul></li>
	<li>Water <img src="https://example.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/team.png" alt="" /></li>
</ul>
<ol>
	<li>First</li>
	<li>Second</li>
</ol>

<blockquote>Travel is the only thing you buy that makes you richer.<cite>Anonymous</cite></blockquote>

[gallery ids="12,13" columns="2"]

<table>
<thead><tr><th>Day</th><th>Distance</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><td>Monday</td><td>40 km</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">Rest day</td></tr></tbody>
</table>

[contact-form-7 id="5" title="Contact form 1"]

Prices in [brackets] stay text, like [sic].

<script>alert("tracking")</script>

<pre class="language-go"><code>fmt.Println("hi")</code></pre>

<img src="https://cdn.other-host.net/banner.png" alt="Banner" />

<!--more-->

The end.]]></content:encoded>
